# gate-m58's world script for phase held: run once, as the singleplayer world's integrated server, by forbricupgradeneo in
# phase write, on a copy of the main save (S2). waystones and sophisticatedbackpacks are in D53's set, but phase main
# cannot carry them (a new client dies joining a server whose mods register particle types), so they are written here,
# in singleplayer, until the orchestrator rules on them. Every line must print "[M58Upgrade] OK command" (D53). The
# chest is the main script's at 0 -60 0; slots 10 and 12 are free there.
#
item replace block 0 -60 0 container.10 with sophisticatedbackpacks:backpack 1
item replace block 0 -60 0 container.12 with waystones:andesite_waystone 1
setblock 6 -60 4 waystones:andesite_waystone[half=lower]
